---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="J 的世界 Research｜Facts First · Evidence-Based Research">
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-inner">
  <div><div class="kicker">J 的世界 Research · 2026</div>
    <h1>把複雜產業，<br/><span>拆成看得懂的證據。</span></h1>
    <p>從產業事件出發，拆解技術、供應鏈與關鍵訊號；以公開資訊為基礎，將研究轉換成可以閱讀、追蹤與驗證的產業地圖。</p>
    <div style="margin-top:28px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="button" href="/research">進入 Research →</a><a class="button" style="background:transparent;color:#eef2f7;border:1px solid #647184" href="/maps">查看產業地圖</a></div>
  </div>
  <a class="hero-card" href="/research"><div class="kicker">Featured Research · Vol.01</div><h2>AI Platform Evolution</h2><p>從台積電技術論壇的關鍵訊號出發，追蹤下一代 AI 平台如何由晶片、封裝、光通訊、材料與電力共同演進。</p><span class="button">閱讀創刊號 →</span></a>
</div></section>

<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">Research Framework</div><h2>從事件，到產業鏈</h2></div><p>Story → Evidence → Technology → Investment Matrix → Future Watch</p></div>
<div class="grid">
<article class="card"><span class="tag">01 · STORY</span><h3>先問：發生了什麼？</h3><p>以重要產業事件建立研究起點，不急著跳到個股。</p></article>
<article class="card"><span class="tag">02 · EVIDENCE</span><h3>再找：哪些訊號可以驗證？</h3><p>將公開資訊、技術文件與公司揭露拆開整理。</p></article>
<article class="card"><span class="tag">03 · TECHNOLOGY</span><h3>最後拆：技術如何落地？</h3><p>從製程、材料、設備到供應鏈，建立技術路徑。</p></article>
</div></section>

<section class="feature"><div class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">Vol.01 · Featured Research</div><h2>AI Platform Evolution</h2></div><p>創刊號主軸</p></div>
<div class="grid">
<div class="map-card"><div class="number">P1 — P2</div><h3>從一場論壇開始</h3><p>建立事件背景，理解 AI 平台為何正在發生結構性變化。</p></div>
<div class="map-card"><div class="number">P3 — P5</div><h3>四個訊號 × 技術演進</h3><p>先進封裝、光通訊、Glass Core 與材料設備形成新的關聯。</p></div>
<div class="map-card"><div class="number">P6 — P8</div><h3>產業對應 × Future Watch</h3><p>將技術節點轉換成供應鏈觀察框架，並保留研究方法與來源。</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">Industry Maps</div><h2>三張核心產業地圖</h2></div><a href="/maps" class="button">全部地圖 →</a></div>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><span class="tag">AI ECOSYSTEM</span><h3>AI 全產業鏈</h3><p>AI Chip → Advanced Packaging → Optical → Server → Power → Cooling</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="tag">GLASS CORE</span><h3>Glass Core Ecosystem</h3><p>Glass → TGV → Core Substrate → Advanced Packaging → AI Accelerator</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="tag">CPO</span><h3>CPO Ecosystem</h3><p>Switch → Optical Engine → Fiber → Packaging → Thermal → Power</p></div>
</div></section>

<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">Editorial Principles</div><h2>研究，不把推論寫成事實。</h2></div></div>
<div class="grid">
<article class="card"><span class="tag">FACTS FIRST</span><h3>公開資訊優先</h3><p>已公告、已驗證與市場推論清楚分層。</p></article>
<article class="card"><span class="tag">EVIDENCE</span><h3>證據導向</h3><p>用技術與供應鏈關係交叉驗證產業訊號。</p></article>
<article class="card"><span class="tag">J INSIGHT</span><h3>Inference 明確標示</h3><p>對尚未公告但值得追蹤的機會，明確標示為產業推論。</p></article>
</div></section>

<section class="cta"><div class="cta-inner"><div><div class="kicker">NEXT</div><h2>這只是第一版。</h2><p>下一階段，將把真正的研究文章、海報與 PDF 資料庫逐步接進網站。</p></div><a class="button" href="/downloads">查看資料庫 →</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
